OL,3,GNEWSAHow 'bright young people'
OL,4,Atransformed a city, 30 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat happens when 5,000 "bright young
OL,7,Fpeople" are dropped into the middle of
OL,8,Fa struggling city? Thirty years ago,
OL,9,FLincoln began to answer that question.
OL,11,FIn the 1980s, the Brayford Pool
OL,12,Fdistrict ` once a busy inland harbour
OL,13,Flined with factories, warehouses and
OL,14,Frailway yards ` was disused and
OL,15,Fderelict.
OL,17,FTanks had been designed and built here
OL,18,Fduring World War One, but like many
OL,19,Fcommunities, the city experienced a
OL,20,Fdecline in traditional manufacturing
OL,21,Findustries.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
