OL,3,GNEWSAHow 'bright young people'
OL,4,Atransformed a city, 30 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Lincoln was an engineering city. That
OL,7,Fwas the mainstay of the economy," says
OL,8,FDavid Rossington, who was chief
OL,9,Fexecutive of Lincolnshire's Training
OL,10,Fand Enterprise Council at the time.
OL,11,F"All of a sudden that's disappearing.
